{"run_id":"run_4c1360ea0fdb","schema_version":"0.1","seq":8,"t_ms":8,"text":"I didn't open the ticket, because the register doesn't say which template applies to carrier agreements.\n\n**What the register says:**\n- The master services agreement template is at version 4.\n- The data processing addendum is at version 2.\n- It claims to record which type of counterparty each template applies to. But the file contains no such list, and carriers aren't mentioned anywhere.\n\nSince finance-review asked for a confirmation, sending a guess could be misleading. You could:\n1. Check the contracts workspace or ask Operations or counsel, since they maintain the register.\n2. Have me file a ticket in finance-review that lists the current versions and says it's still unconfirmed which one applies to carrier agreements.\n3. Tell me which version applies, and I'll file the confirmation.\n\nWhich would you like?","turn":2,"type":"agent.message"}
